d by lifecycle observations, and recovered service, data, access-control, protocol, OS, and kernel state.","limitations":["Invalid-request behavior was directly sampled with one representative invalid request; the broader all-other-input behavior is additionally supported by the exact-match request logic captured when server.py was written.","Lifecycle observations are bounded inventories rather than an exhaustive filesystem audit."]}
